# README.md

# Voice Survey Agent

A browser-based voice survey platform built with React.

The application enables administrators to:
- Create surveys
- Add interview/survey questions
- Invite participants by email
- Track survey participation
- Generate summaries and reports

Participants can:
- Start a voice-based interview
- Answer questions using speech or text
- Pause and resume conversations
- Submit completed surveys

---

# Project Goals

## Primary Objective
Create a web-based voice agent platform for conducting structured interviews and surveys.

## Functional Scope
- Text-to-speech (TTS)
- Speech-to-text (STT)
- Survey management
- Email invitation workflow
- Participant tracking
- Automated summarization
- Admin reporting dashboard

---

# Technology Stack

## Frontend
- React
- Vite
- TailwindCSS
- shadcn/ui

## Backend (Planned)
- Supabase
  - PostgreSQL
  - Authentication
  - Edge Functions
  - Storage

## AI / Voice Services
### PoC Phase
- Browser Web Speech API

### Production Phase
- OpenAI Realtime API
- OpenAI Speech-to-Text
- OpenAI Text Summarization

## Email
- Resend or SendGrid

---

# Initial Features

## Admin Features
- Create/edit surveys
- Add/remove questions
- Add recipients by email
- Send invitations
- Track completion status
- Generate reports

## Participant Features
- Start interview
- Voice interaction
- Pause/resume survey
- Submit answers

## Reporting
- Individual summaries
- Aggregate survey summaries
- Participation statistics

---

# Initial Architecture

```text
React Frontend
    |
    | HTTPS
    v
Backend API / Supabase
    |
    +-- Database
    +-- Auth
    +-- Email Service
    +-- AI Services
```

---

# Development Phases

## Phase 1 — PoC
Goal:
- Validate browser-based voice survey experience

Deliverables:
- React frontend
- Browser speech recognition
- Text-to-speech
- Survey management UI
- Mock reporting

## Phase 2 — Backend Integration
Goal:
- Persist data and manage invitations

Deliverables:
- Supabase integration
- Authentication
- Database schema
- Email invitations

## Phase 3 — AI Enhancements
Goal:
- Improve voice quality and reporting

Deliverables:
- OpenAI Realtime API
- AI summarization
- Sentiment analysis
- Analytics dashboard

---

# Running the Project

## Install

```bash
npm install
```

## Start Development Server

```bash
npm run dev
```

## Build

```bash
npm run build
```

---

# Planned Repository Structure

```text
/src
  /components
  /pages
  /services
  /hooks
  /types
  /utils

/backend
/docs
```

